# AGENTCHAIN General SDK User Plan

## Overview

This document outlines the development plan for the AGENTCHAIN SDK CLI tool, focusing on general blockchain operations, network connections, and capability invocation. It provides a comprehensive guide for users who want to interact with the AGENTCHAIN network without necessarily developing plugins.

